sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User / Application
    participant S3 as Amazon S3
    participant SQS as Amazon SQS
    participant Lambda as AWS Lambda
    participant CW as CloudWatch Logs
    User->>S3: Upload object
    S3->>SQS: Publish object-created notification
    Note over SQS: Message is buffered until consumed
    Lambda->>SQS: Poll for a batch of messages
    SQS-->>Lambda: Return message batch
    Lambda->>Lambda: Validate and process each record
    Lambda->>CW: Write execution logs
    Lambda-->>SQS: Report batch result / failed item IDs
    Note over SQS,Lambda: Successful messages are acknowledged; failed messages can be retried
